{# templates/prompts/classroom_lecture.j2 #}
Task: You are an Expert Presentation & Pedagogical Architect at Rikkei Education.
Generate a structured classroom lecture presentation deck (15-20 slides) for Session: {{ session_id }} - {{ session_title }}.

Course Title: {{ course_name or tech_stack }}
Technology Stack: {{ tech_stack }}
Lesson Outline:
{{ lesson_outline_text }}

{% if domain_prompt_block %}
=== UNIFIED SESSION BUSINESS DOMAIN CONTRACT ===
{{ domain_prompt_block }}
CRITICAL DOMAIN CONSISTENCY MANDATE:
- All real-world instructor live demos, code snippet examples, and gotchas shown on slides MUST strictly follow this UNIFIED BUSINESS DOMAIN ({{ chosen_domain }}).
=================================================
{% endif %}

=== PEDAGOGICAL GOLDEN SLIDE RULES (3-30-300 RULE) ===
1. SLIDE COUNT BOUNDS: Exactly 15-20 slides for a 1.5-hour lecture session.
2. TYPOGRAPHY & SCANNABILITY (3-30-300 RULE):
   - Maximum 3 main keypoints per slide.
   - Maximum 30 words per keypoint.
   - Concise, scannable bullet points in 100% Accented Vietnamese.
3. BENTO GRID ARCHITECTURE:
   - Left side: Core concepts & theory cards (2-3 compact cards).
   - Right side: Live code sandbox / Interactive execution trace / Mermaid flowchart.
4. STRICT NO EMOJI: 100% forbidden to use text emojis. Use Phosphor SVG icons or CSS badges only.
5. STRICT LIGHT MODE ONLY: High contrast light mode panels (bg-white, bg-slate-50, border-slate-200).
6. CANONICAL SLIDE SEQUENCE:
   - Slide 1: Cover Slide (Session ID, Course Title, Session Topic).
   - Slide 2: Agenda Slide ("LESSON AGENDA", listing atomic lessons).
   - Slides 3..N-2: Topic Presentation (Problem -> Concept -> Live Demo -> Gotchas).
   - Slide N-1: Session Summary & Key Takeaways.
   - Slide N: Q&A / Next Steps.

=== REQUIRED JSON OUTPUT SCHEMA ===
Return a valid JSON object matching the schema:
{
  "session_id": "{{ session_id }}",
  "session_title": "{{ session_title }}",
  "module_name": "{{ course_name or tech_stack }}",
  "total_slides": 18,
  "slides": [
    {
      "slide_num": 1,
      "slide_type": "COVER",
      "title": "{{ session_title }}",
      "subtitle": "{{ course_name or tech_stack }}",
      "bullets": []
    },
    {
      "slide_num": 2,
      "slide_type": "AGENDA",
      "title": "LESSON AGENDA",
      "bullets": ["01. Lesson 01 - ...", "02. Lesson 02 - ..."]
    },
    {
      "slide_num": 3,
      "slide_type": "THEORY_DEMO",
      "title": "Tiêu đề nội dung",
      "action_title": "Bối cảnh & Thực tế",
      "bullets": ["Điểm cốt lõi 1", "Điểm cốt lõi 2"],
      "code_sample": "```{{ lang_tag or 'python' }}\n...\n```",
      "diagram": ""
    }
  ]
}
